<title>HONG KONG: Bankers Trust sets Beijing Ent warrants.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets Beijing Ent warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc said on Wednesday it had launched 50 million American-style call warrants on the shares of Beijing Enterprises Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$48.51	   PREMIUM	 14.90 PCT</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$53.90	   GEARING	 4.01X</p>
<p> MATURITY	    04.DEC.97	  MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG	 LAUNCH DATE   04.JUN.97</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.34</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT	  CASH SETTLEMENT IN HONG KONG DOLLAR</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
